{
  "name": "D · Generación de reportes",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Flujo D · Reportes por lote\n\nGenera reportes ejecutivos por servidor y consulta el histórico.\n\n- El backend renderiza PDF, Word o Excel con datos de PostgreSQL.\n- Los reportes incluyen limitaciones y no contienen secretos.\n- Ajuste `format` a `pdf`, `docx` o `xlsx`.\n\nCredencial: `CIS Hardening API Key` con alcance `automation:reports`.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "d0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Documentación",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-720, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 6 1 * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "d0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Mensual, día 1 a las 06:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [-220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "d0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
              "name": "apiBaseUrl",
              "value": "http://host.docker.internal:8000/api/v1",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Configuración",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Configuración').first().json.apiBaseUrl }}/automation/reports/batch",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"format\": \"pdf\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 280000
        }
      },
      "id": "d0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Generar reportes ejecutivos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [240, 0],
      "retryOnFail": false,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "cis-hardening-api-key",
          "name": "CIS Hardening API Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Configuración').first().json.apiBaseUrl }}/reports?page=1&page_size=20",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "d0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Consultar histórico",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [520, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "cis-hardening-api-key",
          "name": "CIS Hardening API Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const batch = $('Generar reportes ejecutivos').first().json;\nconst history = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    generado_en: new Date().toISOString(),\n    reportes_generados: batch.generated ?? 0,\n    errores: batch.failed ?? 0,\n    reportes_recientes: (history.items ?? []).slice(0, 10).map(r => ({\n      id: r.id,\n      archivo: r.file_name,\n      formato: r.format,\n      servidor: r.server_name,\n      descarga: r.download_url\n    })),\n    detalle: batch.items ?? []\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "d0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Resumen de reportes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [800, 0]
    }
  ],
